# Run-output dirs at the repo root (forge/<cmd>-<timestamp>/) are client
# work products, never harness source. Root-anchored: a bare `forge/`
# would also ignore every */skills/forge/ mirror tree.
# /autoresearch/ stays ignored: pre-v3.0.0 run dirs from the old command name.
/forge/
/autoresearch/
